# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exported model artifacts -- NOT tracked.
#
# Every DP/STD notebook writes its target model to <DATASET>/<FAM>/output/model/
# via model_exporter.export_model(). That is ~210 MB across 444 files, and the
# artifacts are reproducible from the notebooks (the export is always the run-0,
# seed-42 draw). They are regenerated, not authored, so they stay out of git.
#
# Consequence to be aware of: the membership inference attacks in Attack/ read
# these files. A fresh clone must re-run the DP/STD notebooks for a dataset
# before its attacks can be run. The attack *results* (CSV/JSON) are tracked, so
# the published numbers remain inspectable without them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
output/model/

# Belt and braces: no model weights anywhere in the tree, whatever the path.
# The six <DATASET>/data/processed_data.pkl files are data, not models, and are
# re-included below.
*.pt
*.pth
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.h5
*.onnx
!*/data/processed_data.pkl

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Jupyter
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*-checkpoint.ipynb

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run logs and scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Long training/attack runs are launched with `python -u ... > *.log`; the logs
# are machine- and run-specific.
*.log
*.bak
*.tmp
*.diabetes_only

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

logs/
!logs/
logs/*
!logs/tracker.md
